/-- Paper p.27, Lemma 5.1: no semisimplicity assumption on the abstract Brauer
algebra is imposed. Printed Eq.(85) overlaps J_1=0 with the dual +dI clause at p=0;
changed the first dual value to dI because its right-addition content is d. -/
theorem lemma_5_1 {d p q : ℕ} (hd : 2 ≤ d) : AdditivelyCentral d p q := by sorry

end

